    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Two-handed iron-headed maul on a long ash haft. Heavy, slow, and absolutely uninterested in your finesse. The Bulwark's first real weapon — the one you swing when subtlety has already failed.</p><p>Heavy two-handed kinetic. No signature — Surge still does the work; the maul just makes the impact mean it.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Two-handed, heavy. Pairs well with a Bulwark's Surge.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d12 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(blunt)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T2</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Bound Working — Pressure Front (TI).</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Carries the Working <strong>Pressure Front</strong>: it appears among your Manifestations as “Pressure Front ⟡ Maul of the Pressure Front” and casts from the item, <strong>no Clarity</strong> — Noise and misfire still apply.</li>\n  <li><strong>3 charges</strong>; one is spent per cast attempt; all recover on a Soma Break.</li>\n  <li><em>Release the front in a 3-square cone: 1d6 kinetic (integrity), and each target saves Body vs Cast DC or is knocked Prone.</em></li>\n  <li>Tier II · attuned (one slot) · technomagical (Witness-forge binding).</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->"
    }
  },
